 1.33x the prior 10-day average of 4.2M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $37.51, and the chart ends at $37.51.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that worked on light volume. The volume rule is a guide, not a law. It tilts the odds, and here the stock beat them."}}